%description:
Tests the ECN state of the first segment after the SYN-ACK, with
tcpEcnMode="rfc3168". The tester delays the ECN-setup SYN-ACK until the client
has data, so the client sends the data at once, in the segment that
acknowledges the SYN-ACK. ECN is in force for that segment, so it is ECT(0)
(RFC 3168 section 6.1.2: the sender sets ECT on its data packets).

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.cli_app.sendScript="1.0 1000"
*.*_tcp.tcpEcnMode = "rfc3168"
*.tcptester.script="b1 delay 2"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[0.001 A001] A.1000 > B.2000: S E W 0:0(0) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
srv_tcp: LISTEN --> SYN_RCVD  (on RCV_SYN)
[0.003 B001] A.1000 < B.2000: A S E 500:500(0) ack 1 win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize# removing original
[2.003 B001] A.1000 < B.2000: A S E 500:500(0) ack 1 win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize# introducing copy
cli_tcp: SYN_SENT --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_SYN_ACK)
[2.005 A002] A.1000 > B.2000: A 1:1001(1000) ack 501 win 16384 ECT(0) 
srv_tcp: SYN_RCVD --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_ACK)
[2.207 B002] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 1001 win 16384 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
